WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Maya: Platform three. Leo said not to be late.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Jonah: You look soaked. I used to work the night shift here.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Maya: That's Leo's train. He always takes the nine-forty.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Jonah: The service tunnel under track two is how someone leaves without being seen.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Jonah: That picture is us. I'm Leo. I changed my name. I had to know if you would still recognize me.
